{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38141","headline":"及第过堂日作 · 韩偓","name":"及第过堂日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早随真侣集蓬瀛，阊阖门开尚见星。\n龙尾楼台迎晓日，鳌头宫殿入青冥。\n暗惊凡骨升仙籍，忽讶麻衣谒相庭。\n百辟敛容开路看，片时辉赫胜图形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}